#ASSERT `employment as` `personal employee (Ministerial)` `by a person occupying` `Prime Minister` `with a section 4 determination in force` FALSE `is authorised by section 11`
#ASSERT NOT `employment as` `personal employee (Ministerial)` `by a person occupying` `shadow Minister` `with a section 4 determination in force` TRUE `is authorised by section 11`
#ASSERT NOT `employment as` `personal employee (non-Ministerial)` `by a person occupying` `Minister other than the Prime Minister` `with a section 4 determination in force` FALSE `is authorised by section 11`
#ASSERT NOT `employment as` `personal employee (non-Ministerial)` `by a person occupying` `shadow Minister` `with a section 4 determination in force` FALSE `is authorised by section 11`
#ASSERT NOT `employment as` `electorate employee` `by a person occupying` `former Prime Minister who is not a parliamentarian` `with a section 4 determination in force` FALSE `is authorised by section 11`

