`Ellis` MEANS `a person named` "Ellis" `with memberships` (LIST Membership WITH `of` IS `another body`, `began on` IS `the day` 2022 1 1, `ended on` IS 0, `still a member` IS TRUE) `, MOP(S) Act engagements` EMPTY `, State or Territory engagements` EMPTY `, party roles` EMPTY `and APS employment` FALSE
`Harper` MEANS `a person named` "Harper" `with memberships` EMPTY `, MOP(S) Act engagements` (LIST `MOP(S) Act engagement` WITH `as` IS `personal employee (non-Ministerial)`, `began on` IS `the day` 2015 1 1, `a section 4 determination was in force for the employer` IS FALSE, `positions the employer occupied during the employment` IS (LIST `former Prime Minister who is not a parliamentarian`)) `, State or Territory engagements` EMPTY `, party roles` EMPTY `and APS employment` TRUE

