-- A leap day: commencement on 29 February 2028; no 29 February 2029, so the 12 months end at the
-- end of February 2029 and a term must start on or after 1 March 2029.
#ASSERT `the day this Act commences` `the leap world` EQUALS `the day` 2028 2 29
#ASSERT `the first day a term may start for s 15 to apply, in` `the leap world` EQUALS `the day` 2029 3 1
-- An appointment to an office that is not designated is not touched.
`Casey to Fiji` MEANS `the appointment of` `Casey` `to` (`another office of the Commonwealth` TRUE FALSE TRUE) `made on` (`the day` 2028 6 1) `, term from` (`the day` 2028 7 1) `, after an appointment on` (`the day` 2024 1 10) `, with Committees` EMPTY
#ASSERT `the appointment` `Casey to Fiji` `was made in accordance with this Act, in` `the world`

